'''Seeing Red''' (赤狩り, ''Akagari'', '''Red Hunt''') were a group of special stages appearing during special occasions.

Each stage included [[Timed Score Reward]]s which feature [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red Enemies]] exclusively. All stages featured XP and a [[Cat Capsule#Normal Cat Capsule|Cat Ticket]] as timed score rewards, with the exception of [[Ruins of the North|Seeing Red ∞]], which had additional rewards. This event was added in [[Version 7.5 Update|Version 7.5]].

